# Epilepsy external news feed source package (pipe-delimited)
#
# Every source is disabled by default and installation requires acceptance of
# the external news feed sources agreement. Display is limited to headline,
# date, publisher attribution and outbound link.
#
source_id|name|endpoint|category|feed_kind|enabled_by_default|publisher|classification|reviewed|fields_displayed|permission|commercial_use|attribution|terms_url|rights_or_corrections_contact|notes
medlineplus-epilepsy|MedlinePlus · Epilepsy|https://medlineplus.gov/feeds/topics/epilepsy.xml|Research|headlineOnly|false|MedlinePlus / U.S. National Library of Medicine|Official epilepsy topic RSS with restricted reuse|2 August 2026|Exact headline, publication date, source attribution and outbound link only|MedlinePlus offers the topic RSS feed, but its content-use policy limits feeds to personal use and does not authorize use in websites or information services|Not authorized by the published RSS terms|Credit MedlinePlus and the U.S. National Library of Medicine and link to the original page|https://medlineplus.gov/about/using/usingcontent/|https://medlineplus.gov/about/contactus.html|Verified HTTP 200 XML. Disabled, agreement-gated and locally filtered for explicit epilepsy relevance; no summary, image or article body is stored or displayed.
nlm-news-epilepsy|National Library of Medicine · News|https://www.nlm.nih.gov/rss/nlmnews.rss|Research|headlineOnly|false|U.S. National Library of Medicine|Official broad NLM news RSS; locally filtered|2 August 2026|Exact headline, publication date, NLM attribution and outbound link only|NLM states that U.S. government works may be used with source acknowledgement; third-party contributions can retain copyright|Government works may be reused; verify third-party material and do not imply endorsement|Credit the National Library of Medicine and link to the original item|https://www.nlm.nih.gov/web_policies.html|https://support.nlm.nih.gov/|Disabled and locally filtered for explicit epilepsy relevance; no summary, image or article body is stored or displayed.
